      "details": {
        "en": {
          "description": "Takismana (タキスマナ) is a voicebank for the UTAU program. A mysterious pilot of alien origin, she navigates the cosmos in her ship, the ''Iris'', accompanied by her best friend – a glass spider Garasu Kumo (ガラス蜘蛛). Takismana’s voice is designed to be clear and expressive, capable of both soft, introspective tones and strong, confident ones. It carries a subtle otherworldly resonance, fitting her alien background. Takismana has a slender build. Her eyes are always hidden behind large, opaque pilot goggles that reflect the stars. Her most striking features are the spiral ******* and the dinosaur‑like ridges along her back. She wears a turquoise pilot’s jumpsuit and a matching helmet in a retro‑space style. She also has a katana, but doesn’t wear it all the time, for necessities only.\nPlease find the technical information in the voicebank readme file.",
          "generalInfo": [
            "Gender: Female",
            "Height: 175 cm",
            "Weight: 58 kg",
